## D1 iOS-parity pass (this change)

The shipped iOS app had grown well past the original Android v1; this pass ports
the full feature (iOS is authoritative).

- **Model** (`TransportationBooking`, `Enums`): round-trip `coversReturn`,
  `TransportationLeg` (outbound/return) × `TransportationCheckpoint`
  (departure/arrival), `TransportationLegProgress`, append-only
  `scanHistory: List<TransportationScanEvent>`, plus `isActive`, `arrivedBy/At`,
  `canceledBy/At`, `cancelReason`. Per-leg helpers (`progress`, `didScan`,
  `isTripComplete`, `nextLeg`, `canBoard` now requires `isActive`). Legacy
  bookings back-fill an outbound timeline from `boardedAt`/`arrivedAt`. Schema
  extended beyond docs `02` §7.2 to match iOS (rules already accept these
  fields since iOS writes them). 4 new scan-result states (arrival success,
  already arrived, inactive, departure-missing).
- **Service**: leg-aware `markBoarded`/`markArrived` (`arrayUnion` scan events +
  legacy outbound mirror), `updatePaymentStatus`, `cancelBooking`
  (`cancelReason` delete-when-empty via passed `deleteField` sentinel). Create
  stays `unpaid` per RBAC.
- **ViewModel**: single shared VM (mirrors iOS observer) backing My Passes,
  Dashboard, Scanner, History; full iOS scan-validation order; grouping helpers
  (`TransportationGrouping.kt`); ops `updatePaymentStatus` / `cancelBooking` /
  `addVoyager` (free option → `waived` via the manager update path).
- **UI**: marshal **Dashboard** (per-leg progress, state-grouped sections,
  payment segmented control, cancel, add-voyager `ModalBottomSheet`),
  **Scan History** audit feed (leg filter), round-trip **BusTicketCard** (leg
  cards + per-checkpoint timeline + perforated stub + QR shown only once
  approved), **Scanner** upgrade (leg/checkpoint mode picker + arrival + per-leg
  live tally). Previews on every screen with fixtures.
- **Navigation**: new `TransportationDashboard` + `TransportationHistory`
  routes; managers now land on the Dashboard (which reaches Scanner + History).
- Passenger fare shows status pills only; the real Stripe PaymentSheet stays in
  D2.
